[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆、集まっていますわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good, everyone is here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "番号ー！\u3000いち！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roll call! One!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "点呼しなくても見れば分かるでしょうが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can all see each other just fine without doing a roll call."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "昨夜、カウントダウンフェスの本番で披露する\n新曲が上がってきましたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The new song for the Countdown Festival arrived last night."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ、新曲！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, a new song?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつの間に！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since when?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フェスの出演権を得たときのために\n事前に準備を進めておいたのですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had it commissioned in advance, in preparation for the day we secured a spot in the festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本番まで時間は限られていますが……やれますわね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time before the performance is limited, but... you can do this, yes?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当たり前でしょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Obviously."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お任せくだされ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "新曲楽しみー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't wait to hear it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、期待していますわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. I'm counting on you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000……あら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? ...Oh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……本番までは残り１週間ほど。\n早速練習に取りかからねば！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...We have about a week until the performance. We should get to rehearsals straight away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは中身を聞いてみないと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should hear the song first..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どんな曲なんだろう！\u3000なんかワクワクするね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder what it sounds like! I'm so excited!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ……ええ。なるほど、状況は分かりました。\nでは、詳しいことは後ほど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... yes. I see. I understand the situation. We'll discuss the details later..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたの？\u3000急に大声出して",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong? You raised your voice just now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あまり良くないお知らせですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm afraid it's not good news."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "カウントダウンフェスの会場が、局所的な大雪に\n見舞われ、復旧までしばらくかかるそうです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Countdown Festival venue has been hit by a severe localized snowstorm. Repairs are expected to take some time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんと！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しばらくって、どれくらい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How long is 'some time'?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あくまで予想の段階ですが、\n最低ひと月はかかるのではないか、と……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's still an estimate at this stage, but they believe it could take at minimum a month..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A month..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃ本番に間に合わないじゃない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That means it won't be ready in time for the performance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一応、別の会場を手配しようとはしているようですが、\n時期が時期ですから、難航しているようですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They are looking into alternate venues, but with the timing being what it is, it sounds like they're running into difficulties."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……残念ながら、\n今のところは中止する方向で動いている、と",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...At this point, I'm sorry to say, cancellation appears to be the direction they're heading."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなあ……せっかく出られることになったのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way... and we finally got to be part of it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、そういう事情じゃ仕方ないか……フェスの\nおかげで名前は売れたんだし、またチャンスはあるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if that's the situation, there's not much we can do... The festival still got our name out there. Another chance will come."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだね！\u3000また来年出られるかも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're right! Maybe we'll get to perform next year!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "来年はもっともっと売れて、\n今度はオファー枠で出てやろうじゃないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next year we'll be even bigger, and this time we'll get invited as a headliner."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]